{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Testudan","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/testudan.webp","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/testudan.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Testudan","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":485,"temp":0,"max":485,"details":""},"ac":{"value":40,"details":"44 with Shell Defense"},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"resistances":[{"type":"physical","value":15,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["draconic","thalassic"],"details":"can't speak any language"},"level":{"value":19},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>A testudan is a massive chimera with faint relations to dragons, with the head of a lion, six bear-like feet, the back of a turtle, and the tail of a serpent. These creatures tend to be solitary, never mingling even with members of their own kind except during mating season. Brash and ornery, the average testudan spends its time bullying smaller creatures and attacking small towns until an army or group of adventurers show up to send it running with its tail between all six of its legs.</p>\n<h2>Testy About Tresses</h2>\n<p>Making a testudan retreat does not always require besting it with a display of strength. It is also possible to strike at its pride. Some towns have reported success hiring a thief to shave off an offending testudan's mane in the dead of night, perhaps with the assistance of a mage with the sleep spell to make doubly sure it does not interrupt the process. The creature, horrified by its crudely shorn locks, hides until it feels it can show its face again.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 5,000/12,000/22,500 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing, slashing), armor (light, medium, heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Athletics, Intimidation)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, constitution, dexterity, elongating, energy resistant (positive), evil, poison, strength, sturdy, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Logan France","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":10},"dex":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":10},"int":{"mod":-2},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":29,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"scent","acuity":"imprecise","range":60}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":37,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":30,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":27,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":37},"intimidation":{"base":32}},"traits":{"value":["amphibious","beast","chaotic","evil"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/testudan.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Darkvision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689127372142,"modifiedTime":1689127372142,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"cCbhC0Dg2e9EGTpE"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Scent (Imprecise) 60 feet","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Scent]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"scent","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689127376203,"modifiedTime":1689127386699,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.rqfnQ5VHT5hxm25r","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"dEofYn9MBolIKMHS"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Always Someone Better","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Though the testudan revels in its strength and power, it fears those who are more powerful than it. If the testudan fails a Will save or Perception check to disbelieve against an illusion that makes it see a creature that appears more powerful than the testudan, it becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 1} and takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage. On a critical failure, it becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2}, takes [[/r 8d6[mental]]] damage, and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Fleeing]{Fleeing} for 1 round. It is then temporarily immune to Always Someone Better for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Ta0nAtyacjJyv7BX","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689127401697,"modifiedTime":1691261012364,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Tail Lash","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within reach of the testudan's serpent tail takes an action to Strike or attempt a skill check</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The testudan Strikes with its serpent tail at the triggering creature at a –2 penalty. If it hits, the creature takes a –2 circumstance penalty to the triggering roll.</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","option":"tail-lash","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["tail-lash"],"selector":" serpent-tail-attack","value":-2}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"gvN77E3TAV4SlZuZ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689127438224,"modifiedTime":1689128197926,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Improved Grab","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedGrab]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"improved-grab","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"free"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default